# okhp3-glee-fully-brand

**OverKill Hill P³** · [overkillhill.com](https://overkillhill.com) · [github.com/OKHP3](https://github.com/OKHP3)

Load `references/glee-fully.yaml` and apply it as the primary profile. Preserve friendly utility, retro-bright warmth, and the profile’s accessibility notes. Do not blend in another family profile unless the user explicitly asks and scopes its supporting role.

## Scope

| In scope | Out of scope |
|---|---|
| Glee-fully SPAs, documentation, presentations, and image briefs | OverKill Hill or AskJamie visual substitutions |
| Approved local-profile application | Shared stylesheet or sibling-repository changes without direction |

